# Macro: {n, t, l, f, block, color}. A l'origen de la caixa: les 12 arestes, barres primes de color que brillen
# (es veuen a traves de les parets). n i f son on comencen (-gruix/2 i mida-gruix/2), l la llargada i t el gruix
$summon minecraft:block_display ~ ~ ~ {Tags: ["daisukes.we", "daisukes.we_edge"], block_state: {Name: "$(block)"}, Glowing: 1b, glow_color_override: $(color), brightness: {sky: 15, block: 15}, view_range: 2f, transformation: {left_rotation: [0f, 0f, 0f, 1f], right_rotation: [0f, 0f, 0f, 1f], translation: [$(n)f, $(n)f, $(n)f], scale: [$(l)f, $(t)f, $(t)f]}}
